# The manuscript must never enter this repository.
#
# GitHub Pages serves every file on the deployed branch with no authentication,
# so a manuscript committed here is a manuscript published here. Git history is
# retrievable too, which means a later deletion does not undo the exposure.
# Keep the text in Drive and behind the entitlement endpoint.
*.docx
*.doc
*.odt
*.rtf
*.epub
*.mobi
*.pages
*.indd
book/*.txt
book/*.md
**/*manuscript*
**/*Manuscript*
**/*chapter-draft*
**/*full-text*
